message: "Please cite this repository's exact version and commit when using the research software, evidence, or Lean formalization."
type: software
title: "Machine-checked Lean 4 formalization of m(41)=47 for minimal pancyclic graphs"
authors:
  - name: "Robinfxa"
    website: "https://github.com/Robinfxa"
version: "v0.2.0-formal-proof"
date-released: 2026-09-22
repository-code: "https://github.com/Robinfxa/JSP-000846"
url: "https://github.com/Robinfxa/JSP-000846/releases/tag/v0.2.0-formal-proof"
abstract: >-
  Machine-checked Lean 4 formal verification of the exact finite value m(41)=47
  for minimal pancyclic graphs (Erdős Problem #1016 / JSP-000846). Contains the
  complete closed formalization of 3,574 modules with root theorem
  JSP846Standard.exact_minimum_41_47, exclusion certificates, explicit 47-edge
  witness, and automated replayers. Proves the finite theorem m(41)=47; does not
  claim a solution to the full asymptotic Erdős Problem #1016 or an award claim.
  Robinfxa identifies the publishing GitHub account; no additional academic
  authorship is assigned. Licensing review remains pending.
keywords:
  - pancyclic graphs
  - formal verification
  - lean4
  - interactive theorem proving
  - computational evidence
  - Erdos Problem 1016
  - JSP-000846
